:''This enemy has no official name.''
'''MikuBear''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = MikuBear
|image = E 505.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although this variant of [[Teacher Bear]] is more powerful, it has [[Single Attack]] attacks which greatly limit its pushing power.

==Strategy==
In the earlier stages you really have nothing to worry about with MikuBear, since it is nerfed heavily. A few fast attackers such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] can knock it out easily. At the harder stages it's recommended to use attackers that deal high damage to get it out of the way easily, with it not posing a huge threat due to its Single Target attacks.

